sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant MQ as RabbitMQ
    participant PW as Process Worker
    participant OS as Order Service
    MQ->>PW: deliver StockReserved
    PW->>MQ: publish OrderProcessingStarted (MessageId derived from OrderId)
    Note over PW: killed during the deterministic delay, before the ack
    Note over MQ: StockReserved returns to the queue
    MQ->>PW: redeliver (restarted Worker)
    PW->>MQ: OrderProcessingStarted again (same MessageId)
    MQ->>OS: Inbox: already processed, no-op
    PW->>MQ: publish OrderProcessed (MessageId = OrderId)
    PW-->>MQ: ack StockReserved
    MQ->>OS: Processing -> Completed once
